      "description": "Watch Cruzeiro vs Mirassol highlights and goals from Brasileirão on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 9, 2026. The match between Cruzeiro and Mirassol , held on August 9, 2026 , brought together two sides eager to make their mark in the Brazilian Serie A . From the opening whistle, the contest was defined by tactical shifts and a physical presence in midfield that kept the result in doubt for much of the evening. Early Breakthrough and Clinical Response Cruzeiro initiated the scoring early in the first half, showcasing their attacking intent. In the 11th minute, Joao Marcelo found the back of the net after being set up by a precise delivery from Bruno Rodrigues . The lead, however, was short-lived as Mirassol refused to back down, gradually increasing the pressure on the home side's backline. The visitors' efforts were rewarded in the 25th minute when a foul by Gerson resulted in a yellow card and a penalty. Reinaldo stepped up for Mirassol and calmly slotted the ball home in the 26th minute to level the score. The remainder of the first half was a balanced affair, with both teams searching for a gap but heading into the tunnel with the score tied at 1-1. Substitutes Make the Difference The second half saw an increase in intensity, with Kenji and Elias both entering the referee's book as the battle for control intensified. Cruzeiro opted for a series of tactical changes around the hour mark, introducing Wesley and Kaio Jorge to provide fresh energy to the frontline. These adjustments proved masterly. In the 76th minute, Fagner provided a brilliant assist for Kaio Jorge , who restored Cruzeiro 's lead with a composed finish. The momentum had clearly swung in favor of the hosts, and they doubled down in the 84th minute. Lucas Villalba turned provider for Wesley , who fired home to make it 3-1. Despite some late friction that saw Shaylon and Wesley cautioned in stoppage time, Cruzeiro held firm to secure a well-earned victory."
